  "translation": "Yesterday was the weekend, the weather was very good. I went to the park with my mom. There were many flowers and trees in the park. We walked for a while, then sat on a chair to rest. I saw a little cat in a tree. Mom took a photo for me. We had a lot of fun. At noon, we went home to eat. To the left of the park there is a small lake. There are fish in the lake. We watched for a long time. Later, we bought ice cream and ate it. At two o'clock in the afternoon, we went home."
